        "upstream_review": null,
        "excerpt": "## Instruction adherence versus accuracy\nScore these dimensions separately. An explicit required output structure, such as JSON, is not optional.\n\nThis guidance does not define a universal preference ordering for a response that is stronger on accuracy but weaker on a required format. When the applicable rules and actual pair do not settle the comparison, provide the exact prompt, both responses and their separate defects for a TL decision. Do not assume facts about the other response."
      },
